---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | AfriMigrate"
  description="AfriMigrate's terms of service: how our free migration planning tools may be used, and important disclaimers about immigration advice."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Terms of Service</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last updated: September 2026</p>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">By using afrimigrate.com, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>

    <h2>2. Not immigration advice</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">AfriMigrate provides free educational tools and general information about immigration programs. We are not a licensed immigration consultancy or law firm, and nothing on this site constitutes regulated immigration advice. Always verify current requirements on official government websites and consult a licensed immigration professional before making decisions.</p>

    <h2>3. Free to use</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our core tools — calculators, checklists and guides — are free to use and will remain free. We may introduce optional paid features in the future; these will always be clearly labelled and will never restrict access to the core free tools.</p>

    <h2>4. Accuracy of information</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We do our best to keep information accurate and current, but immigration rules, fees and processing times change frequently and without notice. We are not liable for decisions made based on information from this site.</p>

    <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">You agree not to misuse the site — including attempting to disrupt our tools, scrape content for commercial resale, or submit false information to our waitlist or calculators.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">We may update these terms as AfriMigrate grows. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink2);">This page is a general template and has not been reviewed by a lawyer. Before AfriMigrate scales up (and especially before introducing paid features), these terms should be reviewed by a qualified professional.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
